{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42262","headline":"和萧少卿见庆新居 · 徐铉","name":"和萧少卿见庆新居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘浦怀沙已不疑，京城赐第岂前期。\n鼓声到晚知坊远，山色来多与静宜。\n簪屦尚应怜故物，稻粱空自媿华池。\n新诗问我偏饶思，还念鹪鹩得一枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}